m shadow-sm to shadow-md on hover. The scale should be restrained (1.02 not 1.1) to feel premium not playful.\",\"reasoning\":\"Interactive elements need tactile feedback. A subtle lift on hover signals clickability and creates the illusion of physical cards the user can pick up. This micro-interaction transforms flat data cards into objects with presence.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:43:38.826Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:43:38.826Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:43:42.655Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01X7UHEbWr6UREj6W7VKiccS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PpTpQ4kpjNGjzh9wPhatVQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"scan_id\": \"0ff65e86-e4db-4340-8c97-0985f032f637\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\n  \"category\": \"ui\",\n  \"title\": \"Add reduced-motion support via useReducedMotion hook\",\n  \"description\": \"AnimatedNumber and AnimatedProgressRing don'\\''t respect prefers-reduced-motion. Create useReducedMotion hook that checks window.matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\"). When true, set spring duration to 0 and skip PulsingDot animations. Pass this context through ThemeContext.\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"Users with vestibular disorders or motion sensitivity need animation-free experiences. This is both an accessibility requirement (WCAG 2.1) and a legal consideration. Implementing centrally in ThemeContext ensures consistent behavior across all animated components.\",\n  \"effort\": 3,\n  \"impact\": 5,\n  \"risk\": 1\n}'","description":"Create idea 5: Reduced motion support"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":135683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"55bd4657-3705-4246-8705-9ed6984b5f1a"}
