dia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\"). When true, set spring duration to 0 and skip PulsingDot animations. Pass this context through ThemeContext.\",\"reasoning\":\"Users with vestibular disorders or motion sensitivity need animation-free experiences. This is both an accessibility requirement (WCAG 2.1) and a legal consideration. Implementing centrally in ThemeContext ensures consistent behavior across all animated components.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:43:43.616Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:43:43.616Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
